      Note","body":"Creates number of  Enemies equal to \"enemycount\" variable,
      populates list to keep track of all characters in scene, sets enemy \"ID\"
      equal to its position in the list (player is always ID 0/ position 0","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"17df37ed-1922-4802-a47a-bc7f730672d4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-436.0,"yMin":504.0,"xMax":-335.0,"yMax":604.0},"title":"Sticky
      Note","body":"On update, causes all units in combat to increment their turn
      meters, then first checks if the player''s turn meter is full, if not then
      checks each enemy turn meter, upon a full turn meter, will initiate turn/action
      for respective unit","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"80bdf51b-000a-4a63-a3e1-23cc7da89ab4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}}'
